{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes! In this game you must blast toy ducks... IN SPACE! Relax, take aim, and let the feathers fly! With light-hearted gameplay and cute ducks to hunt, it's a casual first-person experience full of wholesome, family-friendly fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the moonbase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different areas of the base and uncover what each location has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/9368d0e6ed8b5cf197ea774b2314c5ef.poster.avif?t=1773761161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/9368d0e6ed8b5cf197ea774b2314c5ef.webm?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/9368d0e6ed8b5cf197ea774b2314c5ef.mp4?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with your environment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with objects and characters around you and enjoy playful surprises throughout the maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/a4753cddda4bb2b1c12f47d4a3992d21.poster.avif?t=1773761161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/a4753cddda4bb2b1c12f47d4a3992d21.webm?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/a4753cddda4bb2b1c12f47d4a3992d21.mp4?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Challenge Levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on special levels designed to test your accuracy, timing, and observation skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/744a33f53c94045db6b34c62b63dddd9.poster.avif?t=1773761161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/744a33f53c94045db6b34c62b63dddd9.webm?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/744a33f53c94045db6b34c62b63dddd9.mp4?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Many Weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out a variety of weapons, each offering a fun way to hunt ducks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/50e2d0c05e07cdea718cf814241604e6.poster.avif?t=1773761161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/50e2d0c05e07cdea718cf814241604e6.webm?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/50e2d0c05e07cdea718cf814241604e6.mp4?t=1773761161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test your skills Speedrun mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock and see how quickly you can complete each level!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951570/extras/bfe2183dd12cfdadc77d74f5dbf8dbaa.poster.avif?t=1773761161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://